# characters a frame; while the list is the same as at the last whole walk (re4_list_gen: cManager.h counts the changes
# of the watched list, ObjMgr's), it goes over the kept order and reads only the bodies' atari lines, not the links.
# Same objects, same order, flags read each time: same logic. A port patch.
